{"4191040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Punk Runner", "steam_appid": 4191040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punk Runner</strong> is a <strong>flying-car racing</strong> game set in a cyberpunk open-world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cruise the flying city, meet rivals, and jump into <strong>spontaneous street races that can start at any moment</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will customize your car, level up, and push your stats to beat stronger enemies. The city is always alive, always pushing you to race someone new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/22bcc426fab0094dba6812c157a330cc.poster.avif?t=1764844150\" width=720 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/22bcc426fab0094dba6812c157a330cc.webm?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/22bcc426fab0094dba6812c157a330cc.mp4?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a vertical cyberpunk city filled with traffic, reckless drivers, and hidden shortcuts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Races can start anywhere: a driver challenges you and an outrun breaks out. The game mixes pure speed with RPG rules. Your car has levels, stats, and rare parts that define how you drive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The garage is your base. You unlock new parts, buy limited-time items, and give your ride a look that stands out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade affects how you race. Some rivals hit hard, some outruns require overpowered engines and Some racers might feel unbeatable at first - until you upgrade your ride, raise your stats, and come back stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outruns are tense. Rivals will try to push you out of the way and slow you down as you take the lead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hit can drain your boost, break your speed, or send you off track depending on your build. You earn nitro by dodging impact and driving with style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is about speed, toughness, and staying in control under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/7459903cabfa831b52650bde5f82f307.poster.avif?t=1764844150\" width=720 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/7459903cabfa831b52650bde5f82f307.webm?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/7459903cabfa831b52650bde5f82f307.mp4?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying-car racing in a neon open world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spontaneous encounters and free-roam street races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG progression with player level, car level, and stat-based enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep garage system with unlocks, rare parts, and archetype builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough rivals that require real progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban outruns where collisions affect boost, control, and stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple districts with shortcuts and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who want speed, style, and a fight on every corner</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/f19a6eee6d3f3d3364b35072d9bc305a.poster.avif?t=1764844150\" width=720 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/f19a6eee6d3f3d3364b35072d9bc305a.webm?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/f19a6eee6d3f3d3364b35072d9bc305a.mp4?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Punk Runner</strong> is a <strong>flying-car racing</strong> game set in a cyberpunk open-world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cruise the flying city, meet rivals, and jump into <strong>spontaneous street races that can start at any moment</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will customize your car, level up, and push your stats to beat stronger enemies. The city is always alive, always pushing you to race someone new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/22bcc426fab0094dba6812c157a330cc.poster.avif?t=1764844150\" width=720 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/22bcc426fab0094dba6812c157a330cc.webm?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/22bcc426fab0094dba6812c157a330cc.mp4?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a vertical cyberpunk city filled with traffic, reckless drivers, and hidden shortcuts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Races can start anywhere: a driver challenges you and an outrun breaks out. The game mixes pure speed with RPG rules. Your car has levels, stats, and rare parts that define how you drive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The garage is your base. You unlock new parts, buy limited-time items, and give your ride a look that stands out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade affects how you race. Some rivals hit hard, some outruns require overpowered engines and Some racers might feel unbeatable at first - until you upgrade your ride, raise your stats, and come back stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outruns are tense. Rivals will try to push you out of the way and slow you down as you take the lead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hit can drain your boost, break your speed, or send you off track depending on your build. You earn nitro by dodging impact and driving with style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning is about speed, toughness, and staying in control under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/7459903cabfa831b52650bde5f82f307.poster.avif?t=1764844150\" width=720 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/7459903cabfa831b52650bde5f82f307.webm?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/7459903cabfa831b52650bde5f82f307.mp4?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying-car racing in a neon open world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spontaneous encounters and free-roam street races</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG progression with player level, car level, and stat-based enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep garage system with unlocks, rare parts, and archetype builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tough rivals that require real progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban outruns where collisions affect boost, control, and stability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple districts with shortcuts and hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for players who want speed, style, and a fight on every corner</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/f19a6eee6d3f3d3364b35072d9bc305a.poster.avif?t=1764844150\" width=720 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/f19a6eee6d3f3d3364b35072d9bc305a.webm?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191040/extras/f19a6eee6d3f3d3364b35072d9bc305a.mp4?t=1764844150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A flying-car racing game set in a cyberpunk city, with spontaneous open-world outruns, heavy car customization, and high-speed chases that test your build.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</s